# The desktop app's frontend bundle takes no analytics environment
# variables. GA4 and Microsoft Clarity were removed from the app; they now
# run on the landing site only (see landing/.env.example).
#
# App analytics is PostHog, ingested from the Go process. Its project key is
# injected at build time, not through Vite:
#
#   go build -ldflags "-X main.PostHogAPIKey=phc_xxx"
#
# See docs/privacy.md and internal/analytics.
#
# This file is kept as a placeholder so `cp .env.example .env` does not
# silently resurrect the old IDs.
